      "name": "fhir-artifact-index",
      "renderable": false,
      "summary": "The artefact index of a published FHIR Implementation Guide, reconstructed from its published output — every artefact by canonical URL and published representation, with the DAK API's JSON Schema / JSON-LD sidecars as an overlay where the IG publishes one. No IG publishes such an index itself, so every field records which file it came out of."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#graphKind/ig-pages",
