      "description": "The reconstructed artefact index and the DAK API surface it points at. 40.6 MB of sidecars, materialised on the owner's explicit choice of 'everything' over the 11.3 MB schema+jsonld subset — 133x smart-trust's 332 KB, because this IG publishes 198 schemas and 188 display files against smart-trust's 19 and 14. `index.json` carries a `provenance` block naming the published file every field came out of, and `dakUnbound` records any sidecar an enumeration listed that bound to no artefact.",
